# width: 120
# height: 40
# The focus cue (`ui.focus_cue = .both`, the default — src/ui/focus_cue.zig):
# focus is marked in three places, each through its component, and this
# walks the keys editor → tree → TODOS → editor and reads each one.
#
#   the tab strip  the active chip's name (34,1) — the pane's title —
#                  in the text colour while its pane has the keys, the
#                  dim role (#80848d) while it does not;
#   the pane rail  (31,5), the editor's sign column — its colour
#                  (green, the first ladder slot) while focused,
#                  stepped back toward the ground (#4b5e47) while not;
#   the sidebar    the tree's workspace path (9,1) green while the tree
#                  has the keys and dim while not; a caps header
#                  (TODOS, 5,1) in the accent while focused, the dim
#                  role while not.
#
# The hunt that asked for this typed `:` into the tree and ran tree
# actions: nothing on screen said the keys had left the editor.
write a.txt "alpha\n"
open a.txt
expect screen contains "alpha"
# The editor has the keys.
expect color 34 1 fg #abb2bf
expect color 31 5 fg #98c379
expect color 9 1 fg #80848d
# The tree has them: the editor dims, the tree lights.
command view.focus_tree
expect status contains "\"focus\":\"tree\""
expect color 34 1 fg #80848d
expect color 31 5 fg #4b5e47
expect color 9 1 fg #98c379
# A caps section has them.
command view.activity_todos
expect screen contains "TODOS"
expect color 5 1 fg #61afef
# Back to the editor: the section header steps back, the tab lights.
command view.focus_pane
expect color 5 1 fg #80848d
expect color 34 1 fg #abb2bf
expect color 31 5 fg #98c379
# The two halves alone (`:set ui.focus_cue=…`), the tree holding the keys.
# `dim`: the editor's tab name dims, its rail keeps its colour.
command view.focus_tree
ex set ui.focus_cue=dim
expect color 34 1 fg #80848d
expect color 31 5 fg #98c379
expect color 9 1 fg #98c379
# `rail`: the name keeps the text colour, the rail steps back.
ex set ui.focus_cue=rail
expect color 34 1 fg #abb2bf
expect color 31 5 fg #4b5e47
# The tree's path keeps its green whoever has the keys.
command view.focus_pane
expect color 9 1 fg #98c379
expect color 31 5 fg #98c379
